"""Online payments through Deluxe, against the fake (the `payments` function and the Hosted Payment Form in miniature). Run: python3 tests/test_payments.py
Staff paste the club's Deluxe credentials in Billing setup and the connection is checked; a member pays on the portal through the hosted
form (a token, never a card number), keeps the card and turns autopay on; a declined card posts nothing; Run statements' autopay charges
the balance due; the account page refunds part of a payment (the reversal posts) and charges the card on file; the hub register and a
station take a card through the same sheet; turning autopay off forgets the card."""
